    "_readme": "TITAN CONFIG v10 - MULTI-STRATEGY EDITION. Three active strategies: recent_form, drift_discount, consensus_basket. Open book disabled until rate limits confirmed safe.",
    "_ANALYSIS": {
        "root_causes_of_losses": [
            "1. BUYING NEAR-CERTAINTIES (entry >0.85): tiny upside (15c max), catastrophic downside (-85%). Clavicular pregnancy 0.94 entry -> -97%. WTI crude 0.70 -> -98%.",
            "2. NO STOP LOSSES: whale exit philosophy fails when whales don't exit before resolution. US-Iran deal whale never sold = -96%.",
            "3. STALE SIGNALS: 30min age limit allows copying prices already fully absorbed.",
            "4. HFT SPIKE COPYING: HFT bots have hedged positions we can't see. Their 'spike' is one leg of an arb.",
            "5. FLAWED EV: fair_prob = whale_entry + 0.05 inflates EV for all trades, bypassing the gate.",
            "6. TOO MANY POSITIONS: 5 positions at $7 bankroll = $1.40 average, too small to matter when right, still hurts when wrong."
        ],
        "new_strategy": "MULTI-STRATEGY: recent_form (copy recent winners), drift_discount (discounted entry on dipped positions), consensus_basket (single elite, small bets). All gated to 20-72c price zone."
    },
